WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.080
Quality improves through a feedback loop.

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:06.880
Compare a versioned application with a
baseline on representative and held-out

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:12.080
cases. Use independent checks to decide
whether the candidate meets agreed floors.

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:15.920
Release within an appropriate
boundary, monitor its behavior,

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.960
and curate important failures
into future evaluations.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:24.320
A change in prompts, retrieval, tools
or permissions can change the application.

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:29.760
Assurance therefore continues after the
first release and beyond the model itself.
